      "function": "quests",
      "text": {
        "jp": "ウチの村にアウロラ神殿への巡礼者が立ち寄ります。\n危険な旅なのに信心深くて実に結構なことです。\n彼らを舞で祝福し、旅の安全を祈りたいのです。\n良き舞い手の方がおられたら、是非我が村へ……",
        "official_en": "Pilgrims to Aurora's temple stop by our village.\nI so admire their devotion in spite of the dangerous\njourney, and to honor that, I'd like to bless them with\na dance and a prayer. Please send us a dancer.",
        "real_en": null
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "UNREVIEWED"
      }
    },
